                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is Incredibly fun and addicting, although i do have some very minor complaints and suggestions; the music gets a little repetitive when there's only one track that just repeats on a loop. Maybe add new tracks, or just add a simple audio option to adjust music and sound effect levels. Also would be nice to implement a 'quick restart' key on the keyboard and one on the controller so you don't have to keep going back to the main menu when you die. Another thing that would be very helpful is to able to set a custom color for multiplayer, the light blue they use on the one of the players does not blend well with the white background and it's very hard to see where you are. Overall this game simply rad. Definitely worth a buck.",
